<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>We are for the Lord’s recovery,</l><l>To our hearts so dear;</l><l>When we exercise our spirit,</l><l>Our vision is so clear.</l><l>Babylon the Great is fallen,</l><l>Satan is cast down,</l><l>And the local church is builded</l><l>On the local ground.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
